# Scenario 1, part 2: on the road. Maja drives, Even rides along, Sara and Tom get picked up.
# {{maja}} etc. are the names the players typed in at the start.
# $> friend_walks_to_car("sara") waits until the friend is at the car.
# If Maja found the Smirnoff Ice in the city, each friend finds a bottle on their seat.

~ intro
{{maja}}: Next stop: {{sara}} at the bus stop. Then {{tom}}.
{{even}}: Just follow the road. And please stay on it this time.
{{maja}}: That was ONE time.
=> END

~ sara
{{sara}}: {{maja}}! {{even}}! Over here!
{{sara}}: I packed light, I promise. Just a backpack. And a suitcase. And a sled. And my keyboard.
{{maja}}: Your keyboard?
{{sara}}: For the cabin! Music makes everything better.
{{even}}: The boot is already full of snacks.
=> sara_choice

~ sara_choice
{{sara}}: So... what stays behind?
- The sled. We can slide down the hill on trays.
	{{sara}}: Sliding on trays! I love it. Bye, sled!
	$> set_flag("sara_left_sled")
	=> sara_joins
- The keyboard. You can hum instead.
	{{sara}}: Hum? For a whole week?
	{{maja}}: You're a great hummer.
	{{sara}}: ...I AM a great hummer. Fine!
	$> set_flag("sara_left_keyboard")
	=> sara_joins
- Nothing. {{even}} can sit on the sled.
	{{even}}: Excuse me?
	{{sara}}: Perfect, it's decided!
	$> set_flag("even_on_sled")
	=> sara_joins

~ sara_joins
{{sara}}: Here I come!
$> friend_walks_to_car("sara")
if Inventory.has("smirnoff_ice")
	=> ice_sara
$> friend_gets_in("sara")
=> END

~ ice_sara
{{sara}}: Ooh, a present on my seat! Is it chocolate?
{{sara}}: ...It's a Smirnoff Ice. Oh no. Oh NO.
{{maja}}: Rules are rules, {{sara}}.
{{sara}}: At a bus stop? In front of everybody?
{{maja}}: One knee. One gulp. Go.
$> drink_ice("sara")
{{sara}}: Bleh. So sweet. ...A man on the bus just gave me a thumbs up, though.
$> friend_gets_in("sara")
=> END

~ tom
{{tom}}: Halt! Who goes there?
{{maja}}: It's us, {{tom}}. Get in.
{{tom}}: Not so fast. Only those who know the secret password may enter this car.
{{maja}}: It's MY car.
=> tom_choice

~ tom_choice
{{tom}}: The password, please.
- Snacks?
	{{tom}}: Good guess. But no.
	=> tom_choice
- Mountain?
	{{tom}}: Too obvious. Try again.
	=> tom_choice
- There is no password. Get in or walk.
	{{tom}}: ...That was the password. Welcome aboard!
	=> tom_news

~ tom_news
{{tom}}: Oh, weird thing. This morning a guy was hitchhiking up the mountain road.
{{tom}}: Old ski suit. Beer in one hand, cigarette in the other.
{{even}}: Wait. Like the fifth guest?
{{tom}}: The what?
{{maja}}: Nothing. Probably nothing.
$> friend_walks_to_car("tom")
if Inventory.has("smirnoff_ice")
	=> ice_tom
$> friend_gets_in("tom")
=> END

~ ice_tom
{{tom}}: Shotgun! Wait. Why is there a bottle on the... no. No, no, no.
if flag("iced_even") and flag("iced_sara")
	{{even}}: Welcome to the club. We both got one.
elif flag("iced_sara")
	{{sara}}: Ha! I had to do it at the bus stop!
{{tom}}: Fine. For the honour of the trip.
$> drink_ice("tom")
{{tom}}: ...I can taste every colour of the rainbow. Mostly the bad ones.
$> friend_gets_in("tom")
=> END

~ mountain_sign
if flag("sara_joined") and flag("tom_joined")
	{{maja}}: Everyone's in. Mountains, here we come!
	if Inventory.has("smirnoff_ice")
		{{maja}}: There's still a bottle of Smirnoff Ice left. I'll save it for whoever turns up next.
	$> finish()
elif flag("sara_joined")
	{{maja}}: Not without {{tom}}. The house by the road, a bit further on.
elif flag("tom_joined")
	{{maja}}: We forgot {{sara}}! The bus stop, back there.
else
	{{maja}}: I can't leave without {{sara}} and {{tom}}.
=> END
